      "object": "Sample was not a clinical sample. We did not show that dance class-related learning was related to diagnosable dysfunction. The study was cross-sectional and so does not constitute a test of the temporal or causal aspect of the proposed influences of dance class-related learning or of expectancy theory. Our measures of thinness-related learning in dance class was retrospective, so those learning reports may thus be subject to recall bis."
